    "title": "Masonry Building Trades Training Program deadline set for August 26 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "MISSISSIPPI (KTVE/KARD) — The Masonry Building Trades Training Program deadline is August 26, 2025. Courtesy photo This is the perfect time to get hands-on experience in becoming a brickmason and learn a valuable, in-demand trade. The Student Orientation will be on Thursday, August 28, 2025, from 10 a.m. to 11 a.m. at the Copiah-Lincoln Community College on 30 Campus Drive. If you need more information or have questions, contact Lakitsha Rogers-Davis, Workforce Development Program Coordinator, at (601) 443-3066. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KTVE - myarklamiss.com.",
